+|---|---|---|---|
+| **Memory (DB recall)** | YES | **MOSTLY** | 569 rows w/ embeddings; 193 hook fires, **53 injections (27.5%; 36% recently)**; BGE daemon up 65% of fires; **32% subprocess timeouts**, ~9–12s latency |
